msgid ""
"Cron sweep only enqueues posted invoices whose ``invoice_date`` is on or "
"after this date. Stamped to today the first time the backend transitions to "
"``authorized`` so a fresh install does not retroactively flood freee with "
"every historical invoice. Admin-editable for back-dated catch-up."
msgstr ""

